---
import OptimizedImage from "../../layouts/utilities/OptimizedImage.astro";
---

<section>
  <div class="px-8 py-24 mx-auto md:px-12 lg:px-24 max-w-7xl relative">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <p class="text-sm leading-normal font-bold uppercase text-accent-600">
        Hedef Kullanıcılar
      </p>
      <h2
        class="text-xl leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl mt-4 font-bold text-accent-600">
        Enerji Yoğun İşletmeler için Özel Çözüm
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base leading-normal mt-4 text-base-600 font-medium">
        Aylık elektrik faturası yüzbinlerce TL'ye çıkan işletmeler için tasarlanmış, 
        endüstri deneyimimizle geliştirilmiş güçlü bir platform.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 justify-center mt-12">
        <a
          href="https://app.covolt.com.tr/auth/v1/register"
          class="flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-200 focus:ring-2 focus:outline-none text-white bg-accent-600 hover:bg-accent-700 focus:ring-accent-500/50 h-10 px-6 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-md">
          Demo Talep Edin
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-16">
      <div class="scroll-card group bg-white/70 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl p-8 border border-[#191265] hover:border-[#191265] hover:bg-white/90 transition-all duration-500 ease-out hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-gray-200/20" data-delay="0">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 bg-accent-600/10 rounded-2xl mb-6 group-hover:bg-accent-600/15 transition-colors duration-300">
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            class="w-8 h-8 text-accent-600">
            <path d="M3 21h18M4 18h16M6 18v-6l8-4 8 4v6M8 21v-9h8v9"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4 tracking-tight">
          Enerji Yoğun Endüstriler
        </h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-base font-medium mb-6">
          Çimento, demir-çelik, kimya, gıda ve lojistik sektöründeki işletmeler için özel olarak optimize edilmiş çözümler.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          <li class="flex items-center text-gray-700 font-medium">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-600 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
            </svg>
            Fabrika ve sanayi tesisleri
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center text-gray-700 font-medium">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-600 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
            </svg>
            Organize sanayi bölgeleri
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="scroll-card group bg-white/70 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl p-8 border border-[#191265] hover:border-[#191265] hover:bg-white/90 transition-all duration-500 ease-out hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-gray-200/20" data-delay="200">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 bg-accent-600/10 rounded-2xl mb-6 group-hover:bg-accent-600/15 transition-colors duration-300">
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            class="w-8 h-8 text-accent-600">
            <path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4 tracking-tight">
          Büyük Zincirler
        </h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-base font-medium mb-6">
          AVM, market zincirleri ve otel grupları gibi çok tesisli işletmeler için merkezi yönetim çözümleri.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          <li class="flex items-center text-gray-700 font-medium">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-600 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
            </svg>
            Alışveriş merkezleri
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center text-gray-700 font-medium">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-600 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
            </svg>
            Otel ve restoran zincirleri
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="scroll-card group bg-white/70 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl p-8 border border-[#191265] hover:border-[#191265] hover:bg-white/90 transition-all duration-500 ease-out hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-gray-200/20 md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1" data-delay="400">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 bg-accent-600/10 rounded-2xl mb-6 group-hover:bg-accent-600/15 transition-colors duration-300">
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            class="w-8 h-8 text-accent-600">
            <path d="M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.29 1.51 4.04 3 5.5Z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4 tracking-tight">
          Orta Ölçekli İşletmeler
        </h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-base font-medium mb-6">
          Aylık elektrik faturası yüzbinlerce TL'ye çıkan tüm işletmeler için uygun maliyetli çözümler.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          <li class="flex items-center text-gray-700 font-medium">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-600 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
            </svg>
            Sanayi tesisleri
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center text-gray-700 font-medium">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-600 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
            </svg>
            Lojistik merkezleri
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


